// gleam_erlang, reviewed against the source of 1.0.0, 1.1.0, 1.2.0 and 1.3.0.
// A message sent to a process escapes to code graded does not see: sending
// runs it. A selector holds its handlers and runs them when it receives; what
// a process receives from its mailbox is undescribed.

